  "body_markdown": "Book Appointment\n\nSanta Monica Center\n\nJun 21, 2024\n\n\n# All-on-Four Dental Implants: Your Same-Day Smile Transformation in Santa Monica\n\n\nAre you tired of living with missing teeth or struggling with uncomfortable dentures? Imagine regaining your confident smile and enjoying your favorite foods again in just one day. With All-on-Four dental implants, this dream can become a reality.\n\n\n## What are All-on-Four Dental Implants?\n\n\nAll-on-Four is a revolutionary dental implant procedure that can replace an entire arch of missing teeth using just four strategically placed implants. This innovative technique offers a permanent, stable, and natural-looking solution for those who have experienced significant tooth loss.\n\n\n### How Does It Work?\n\n\nThe All-on-Four procedure involves the following steps:\n\nConsultation and Planning: Your oral surgeon will assess your oral health, bone density, and overall medical condition to determine if you’re a suitable candidate for All-on-Four.\n\nImplant Placement: During a single surgical procedure, four dental implants are strategically placed in your jawbone.\n\nTemporary Bridge Attachment: A temporary set of teeth is attached to the implants on the same day, allowing you to leave with a brand-new smile.\n\nHealing and Integration: Over the next few months, the implants will fuse with your jawbone, providing a strong and stable foundation for your permanent teeth.\n\nPermanent Prosthesis Placement: Once the implants have fully integrated, your oral surgeon will replace the temporary bridge with a custom-designed, permanent prosthesis that looks and feels like natural teeth.\n\n\n### Why Choose All-on-Four?\n\n\nAll-on-Four dental implants offer numerous advantages over traditional dentures and implant methods:\n\nImmediate Results: You’ll leave the office with a new smile on the same day as your surgery.\n\nMinimally Invasive: The procedure requires fewer implants and often eliminates the need for bone grafting.\n\nEnhanced Stability: The four implants provide a secure foundation for your new teeth, preventing slippage and discomfort.\n\nImproved Function: You can eat, speak, and laugh with confidence, just like you would with natural teeth.\n\nLong-Term Solution: With proper care, All-on-Four implants can last a lifetime.\n\nNatural-Looking Results: Your new teeth will be custom-designed to blend seamlessly with your facial features.\n\n\n## Meet Our Expert Surgeons\n\n\nAt Santa Monica Center for Oral Surgery & Dental Implants, our team of highly skilled and experienced oral surgeons is dedicated to providing you with the highest quality care. Dr. Howard Park, Dr. Richard Ting, Dr. Gil Ivry, Dr. Jeffrey Tanner, and Dr. Derek Vajda are all board-certified oral and maxillofacial surgeons with extensive experience in dental implant procedures. They are committed to staying at the forefront of dental implant technology and techniques to ensure you receive the best possible results.\n\n\n## Your All-on-Four Journey Begins Today\n\n\nIf you’re ready to transform your smile and regain your confidence, All-on-Four dental implants may be the perfect solution for you. Contact the experienced team at Santa Monica Center for Oral Surgery & Dental Implants today to schedule a consultation and learn more about this life-changing procedure. We’ll provide personalized care and guide you through every step of your All-on-Four journey, helping you achieve the smile of your dreams.\n\nContact us today to schedule a consultation and take the first step towards a confident, radiant smile and renewed quality of life.\n\n\n#### You May Also Like\n\n\n\n###### Wisdom Teeth Removal Recovery: A Day-by-Day Guide to Healing\n\n\nRead More\n\n\n###### Oral Surgeon Los Angeles: How to Choose the Right Practice Without Guessing\n\n\n\n###### Sleep Apnea Surgery: Oral Surgery Solutions\n\n\n\n##### Wisdom Teeth Removal Recovery: A Day-by-Day Guide to Healing\n\n\n\n##### Oral Surgeon Los Angeles: How to Choose the Right Practice Without Guessing\n\n\n\n### Ready to Transform Your Smile? Schedule Your Beverly Hills Consultation Today\n\n\nDon't let dental concerns hold you back from the confidence and oral health you deserve. Our Beverly Hills location offers the same exceptional care that has made us the premier choice for oral surgery in West Los Angeles and Beverly Hills for 50 years.\n\nBook Your Beverly Hills Appointment\n\n\n##### Ready to Transform Your Smile? Schedule Your Beverly Hills Consultation Today\n\n\n\n##### Ready to Transform Your Smile? Schedule Your Beverly Hills Consultation Today\n\n\n\n#### Location\n\n\nWe'd love to hear from you. Contact us today!\n\n\n##### Email\n\n\nSend us an email\n\ninfo@santamonicaoms.com\n\n\n##### Address\n\n\n2001 Wilshire Blvd, Ste. 600\n\nSanta Monica, CA 90403\n\n\n##### Phone\n\n\nGive us a call\n\n(310) 315-1034\n\n\n#### Office Hours\n\n\nClosed on Sunday and public holidays.\n\nMonday\n\nTuesday\n\nWednesday\n\nThursday\n\nFriday\n\nSaturday\n\nSunday\n\n7 am - 5 pm\n\n7 am - 4:30 pm\n\nClosed\n\n\n###### Email\n\n\n\n###### Address\n\n\n\n###### Phone\n\n\n\n###### Office Hours\n\n\nLocation\n\n\n#### Location\n\n\n\n##### Email\n\n\n\n##### Address\n\n\n\n##### Phone\n\n\n\n#### Office Hours\n\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\nAbout Us\n\nOur Surgeons\n\nOur Office\n\nTestimonials\n\nBlog\n\nReferring Doctors\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\nOrthognathic (jaw) Surgery\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nSinus Lift\n\nFacial Trauma\n\nTeeth-in-an-Hour™\n\nAll-on-four Dental Implants\n\nDental Implants\n\nWisdom Teeth Removal\n\n\n###### For Patients\n\n\nPay Your Bill\n\nFirst Visit\n\nPatient Registration\n\nFinancial Information\n\nBefore Anesthesia\n\nAfter Dental Implant Surgery\n\nAfter Tooth Extraction\n\nAfter Wisdom Tooth Surgery\n\nAfter Exposure Of An Impacted Tooth\n\nAfter The Removal Of Multiple Teeth\n\nJaw Fracture\n\nOrthognathic Surgery\n\nSinus Augmentation\n\n© 2025 Santa Monica Center. All 